Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.70,Cap,The three most expensive decisions you will make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:06.00,Cap,as a real estate investor are when to sell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:09.80,Cap,when to refinance, and when to 1031 exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.30,Cap,And notice, none of these are when to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.10,Cap,Everybody teaches buying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.50,Cap,and there are thousands of hours of free content
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.50,Cap,on how to find a deal, how to analyze a deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.20,Cap,even on our site, how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.40,Cap,Also, nobody teaches you what to do with the thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.30,Cap,after you own it, which is a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:26.90,Cap,because that's where most of the money actually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.20,Cap,It's in the operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:30.20,Cap,and it's in the dispose of the property.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.20,Cap,If you get these three things right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:33.60,Cap,you can keep six figures.
